@startuml
!include style.puml

title Command journal lifecycle

state Pending <<pending>>
state InFlight <<pending>>
state Unreachable <<blocked>>
state Indeterminate <<blocked>>
state ConfirmedCompleted <<ready>>
state ConfirmedAborted <<ready>>
state ConfirmedNotDelivered <<ready>>

[*] --> Pending : CommandId allocated

Pending  --> InFlight : PDU handed to transport
InFlight --> InFlight : NEVER_SEEN and\nreissue guard met

InFlight --> ConfirmedCompleted    : record COMPLETED
InFlight --> ConfirmedAborted      : record ABORTED
InFlight --> ConfirmedNotDelivered : NEVER_SEEN,\nreissue declined
InFlight --> Unreachable   : T_RESOLVE expired
InFlight --> Indeterminate : outcome EVICTED

Unreachable   --> InFlight : next session established
Indeterminate --> ConfirmedCompleted    : user verifies at pump
Indeterminate --> ConfirmedNotDelivered : user verifies at pump

ConfirmedCompleted    --> [*]
ConfirmedAborted      --> [*]
ConfirmedNotDelivered --> [*]

note right of Unreachable
  The question has not been asked yet.
  It will be asked again automatically.
end note

note right of Indeterminate
  The question was asked and the pump
  could no longer answer it. Retrying
  will never change that, so resolution
  needs a human at the pump.
end note

@enduml
